{"id": "17-1203-2-14", "zh": "阴性时为“tā + si”，这里经 s 替换与 si 省略而成。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1203-15-19", "zh": "sā kaññā（那个少女）；t 也可变为 n。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "17-1203-20-40", "zh": "nā、tā，nāyo、tāyo；naṃ、taṃ；nā、tā，nāyo、tāyo；nāya、tāya；nāhi、tāhi，nābhi、tābhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1204-2-30", "zh": "“etimāsamī”一规则中的 etimā 一词，与“tassā vā”一规则中的 ta 一词，都以第五格的形式延续下来；“vā”也延续下来。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1205-2-8", "zh": "215. 其后的 sa 变为 ssāya。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1206-2-15", "zh": "在 tā、etā、imā 之后的 sa 格尾，可以替换为 ssāya。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1207-2-13", "zh": "“saṃsāsvekavacanesu ca”与“i”也延续下来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1208-2-7", "zh": "216. tā 的（末音）可变（为 i）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1209-2-15", "zh": "当 saṃ、sā、su 以及单数的格尾替换形在后时，用于阴性的 tā 一词的末音可以变为 i。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1209-16-29", "zh": "tissāya、tassāya、assāya、nassāya、assā、nassā、tissā、tassā、nāya、tāya；nāsaṃ、tāsaṃ。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1210-2-4", "zh": "第五格、第六格与第三格、第四格相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1210-5-15", "zh": "第七格：assaṃ、nassaṃ、tissaṃ、tassaṃ、nāyaṃ、tāyaṃ；nāsu、tāsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1211-2-8", "zh": "中性时，si 在后没有 s 替换，因此变为 n。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1211-9-25", "zh": "naṃ、taṃ，nāni、tāni；naṃ、taṃ，nāni、tāni；nena、tena，等等，与阳性相同。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1212-2-14", "zh": "eta + si，依“etatesaṃ to”一规则替换为 s。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1212-15-26", "zh": "eso puriso（这个人），ete；etaṃ，ete，等等，与 sabba 一词的变化相同。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1213-2-9", "zh": "阴性时为 etā + si，作 s 替换。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1213-10-25", "zh": "esā kaññā（这个少女），etā、etāyo；etaṃ，etā、etāyo；etāya；etāhi、etābhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1214-2-14", "zh": "至于 sa、smiṃ、su，则延续“saṃsāsvekavacanesu ca”。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1215-2-6", "zh": "217. etā、imā 的（末元音）变为 i。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1216-2-15", "zh": "因与“末尾”相关而用第六格：当 saṃ、sā、su 以及单数的格尾替换形在后时，etā、imā 的末元音变为 i。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1216-16-20", "zh": "由于 ssāya 替换与 sā 替换的性质相同，在 ssāya 替换时也适用。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1216-21-26", "zh": "依 ca 一词的管辖，aññā、ekā 等词的末音也同样变化。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1217-2-25", "zh": "etissāya、etissā、etāya，etāsaṃ、etāsānaṃ；etāya；etāhi、etābhi；etissāya、etissā、etāya，etāsaṃ、etāsānaṃ；etissaṃ、etāyaṃ；etāsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1218-2-9", "zh": "依 ca 一词：aññissā、aññāya，aññissaṃ、aññāyaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1218-10-15", "zh": "ekissā、ekāya，ekissaṃ、ekāyaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1218-16-22", "zh": "itarissā、itarāya，itarissaṃ、itarāyaṃ，等等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1219-2-13", "zh": "中性：etaṃ，etāni；etaṃ，etāni；其余可以类推。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1220-2-5", "zh": "ima 一词的变化。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1220-6-8", "zh": "ima + si ——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1221-2-9", "zh": "“sabbassimassā”延续下来。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1222-2-7", "zh": "218. 非中性者，si 在后时变为 ayaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1223-2-15", "zh": "当 si 格尾在后时，非中性的 ima 一词整个替换为 ayaṃ，并省略 si。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1223-16-24", "zh": "ayaṃ puriso（这个人），ime；imaṃ，ime。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1224-2-9", "zh": "219. nā 在后时也（变为）ana、imi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1225-2-12", "zh": "当 nā 格尾在后时，ima 一词整个替换为 ana、imi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1225-13-15", "zh": "这里只指非阴性的 ima。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1225-16-18", "zh": "anena、iminā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1226-2-9", "zh": "“sunaṃhisu”延续下来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1227-2-7", "zh": "220. 整个 ima 可变为 e。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1228-2-14", "zh": "当 su、naṃ、hi 这些格尾在后时，整个 ima 一词可以变为 e。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1229-2-6", "zh": "由于没有标示以 ā 结尾的形式，也没有说“一切处”，", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "17-1230-2-6", "zh": "所以这里的 imassa 只指非阴性。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1231-2-6", "zh": "ehi、ebhi、imehi、imebhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1232-2-16", "zh": "“sabbassa”、“vā”、“sabbattha”、“sasmāsmiṃsaṃsāsvattaṃ”也延续下来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1233-2-7", "zh": "221. ima 一词也（如此）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1234-2-18", "zh": "当 sa、smā、smiṃ、saṃ、sā 这些格尾在后时，ima 一词整个也可以变为 a，在所有的性中都是如此。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1235-2-33", "zh": "assa、imassa，esaṃ、esānaṃ、imesaṃ、imesānaṃ；asmā、imasmā、imamhā；ehi、ebhi、imehi、imebhi；assa、imassa，esaṃ、esānaṃ、imesaṃ、imesānaṃ；asmiṃ、imasmiṃ、imamhi；esu、imesu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1236-2-8", "zh": "阴性时为 imā + si，经 ayaṃ 替换与 si 省略而成。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1237-2-17", "zh": "ayaṃ kaññā（这个少女），imā、imāyo；imaṃ，imā、imāyo；imāya；imāhi、imābhi。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1237-18-37", "zh": "第四格：变为 a，并有 i 化与 ssāya 替换，得 assāya、imissāya、assā、imissā、imāya；imāsaṃ、imāsānaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1237-38-56", "zh": "第七格：assaṃ、imissaṃ，或 imissā——依“tesu vuddhilopā”等规则，smiṃ 格尾可以替换为 sā。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1237-57-60", "zh": "imāyaṃ；imāsu。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1237-61-63", "zh": "其余可以类推。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1238-2-16", "zh": "中性时为 ima + si，“savibhattissa”与“vā”也延续下来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1239-2-8", "zh": "222. 中性时，ima 在 aṃ、si 前变为 idaṃ。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1240-2-15", "zh": "当 aṃ、si 在后时，用于中性的 ima 一词连同格尾整个可以变为 idaṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1241-2-29", "zh": "idaṃ cittaṃ virocati（这幅画很美），imaṃ，imāni；idaṃ pupphaṃ passasi（你看这朵花），imaṃ，imāni；anena、iminā；ehi、ebhi、imehi、imebhi，等等，可以照阳性类推。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1242-2-5", "zh": "amu 一词的变化。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1242-6-8", "zh": "amu + si ——", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1243-2-14", "zh": "“vā”、“anapuṃsakassa”、“simhi”也延续下来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1244-2-8", "zh": "223. amu 的 m 变为 s。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1245-2-13", "zh": "当 si 在后时，非中性的 amu 一词的 m 可以变为 s。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1245-14-16", "zh": "asu rājā（那位国王）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1246-2-12", "zh": "“sabbanāmato”与“vā”也延续下来。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1247-2-7", "zh": "224. 一切代词之后加 ka。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-1248-2-9", "zh": "在一切代词之后，可以加 ka 这一增音。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1248-10-16", "zh": "又因再次使用 sabbato 一词，hīna 等词之后也加 ka。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1248-17-31", "zh": "依“amussa mo saṃ”一规则，不受管辖地单独运用，在加了 ka 时也作 s 替换。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "17-1249-2-8", "zh": "asuko，asukā，asukaṃ。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "17-1249-9-17", "zh": "没有 s 替换时：amuko，amukā，amukaṃ，等等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-1250-2-26", "zh": "复数时，凭“lato vokāro ca”一规则中延续下来的 vā 一词，不变为 o；yo 一律省略，并且末元音变长。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1251-2-17", "zh": "amū purisā（那些人），amuṃ，amū；amunā；amūhi、amūbhi、amuhi、amubhi；amussa。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1251-18-57", "zh": "依“amussāduṃ”一规则，不受管辖地单独运用，替换为 aduṃ，得 adussa；amūsaṃ、amūsānaṃ、amusaṃ、amusānaṃ；amusmā、amumhā；amūhi、amūbhi、amuhi、amubhi；amussa、adussa；amūsaṃ、amūsānaṃ、amusaṃ、amusānaṃ；amusmiṃ、amumhi；amūsu、amusu。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-1252-2-7", "zh": "阴性时，si 在后作 s 替换等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1253-2-43", "zh": "asu kaññā（那个少女），或 asukā、amukā；amū、amuyo；amuṃ，amū、amuyo；amuyā；amūhi、amūbhi；amussā、amuyā，amūsaṃ、amūsānaṃ；amuyā；amūhi、amūbhi；amussā、amuyā，amūsaṃ、amūsānaṃ；amussaṃ、amuyaṃ、amuyā；amūsu。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1254-2-4", "zh": "中性时为 amu + si。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "17-1254-5-22", "zh": "“savibhattissa”，以及从“imassidam”等规则延续来的“aṃsisu napuṃsake”，也延续下来。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-1255-2-6", "zh": "225. amu 变为 aduṃ。", "confidence": 80}
